WEBVTT

00:00:16.060 --> 00:00:16.940
I'm sleepy.

00:00:21.400 --> 00:00:23.860
<i>But he forced this assignment on me...</i>

00:00:27.160 --> 00:00:30.700
<i>I don't ever recall saying</i>
<i>I wanted to become an Angler.</i>

00:00:51.520 --> 00:00:53.810
Unit Zero, capture him!

00:00:57.480 --> 00:00:59.980
Hurry! What are you waiting for?

00:01:00.360 --> 00:01:02.230
Do you want to get punished again?

00:01:12.040 --> 00:01:13.250
He's a Lachter.

00:01:14.710 --> 00:01:17.210
Those who can't treat others
like they're human...

00:01:18.460 --> 00:01:20.090
can't be considered human themselves.

00:03:14.530 --> 00:03:17.870
DESPAIR

00:03:48.980 --> 00:03:49.940
Master!

00:03:50.860 --> 00:03:55.530
Master! Unit Zero is famished
and cannot do anything...

00:04:13.880 --> 00:04:16.600
We continued to see no results
after the 37th round.

00:04:17.140 --> 00:04:21.100
No sign of increased physical activity
or manifestation of Imagine Lacht.

00:04:22.270 --> 00:04:24.020
Prepare for the next round.

00:04:25.270 --> 00:04:28.060
Unit Zero is depleted of energy.

00:04:28.480 --> 00:04:29.780
If something happens...

00:04:30.110 --> 00:04:32.610
The weakened state
is exactly what we want.

00:04:33.280 --> 00:04:35.910
Exposing Unit Zero to
further struggle and despair

00:04:36.200 --> 00:04:39.740
is the only thing that will
trigger her true Lacht ability.

00:04:58.640 --> 00:04:59.640
I want to go home...

00:05:00.260 --> 00:05:01.850
I want to go home, sir.

00:05:22.200 --> 00:05:25.540
I wonder if he ate a proper dinner...

00:05:26.870 --> 00:05:29.580
Is he even alive?

00:05:30.750 --> 00:05:31.670
Earlier...

00:05:39.640 --> 00:05:42.010
<i>I'm sure he's alive.</i>

00:05:42.260 --> 00:05:44.680
<i>He'll come save me.</i>

00:05:45.140 --> 00:05:45.980
<i>I know it!</i>

00:05:48.600 --> 00:05:49.440
Eat this.

00:06:00.950 --> 00:06:03.120
You better be grateful for that food.

00:06:04.700 --> 00:06:07.210
You always got special treatment.

00:06:14.210 --> 00:06:16.760
So they caught you again too.

00:06:18.170 --> 00:06:19.720
I know you from before...

00:06:20.510 --> 00:06:22.050
They called me Unit Six.

00:06:22.760 --> 00:06:24.310
Are you a Lachter too?

00:06:27.850 --> 00:06:30.270
No... Not anymore...

00:06:38.450 --> 00:06:40.240
What do you mean?

00:07:09.770 --> 00:07:12.650
Game of tag is your favorite, I see.

00:07:12.940 --> 00:07:13.860
Damn it.

00:07:14.060 --> 00:07:16.270
I told you there's no escape.

00:07:23.570 --> 00:07:25.240
He stole my powers.

00:07:26.580 --> 00:07:30.790
That bastard... We're all just
tools at his disposal.

00:07:32.920 --> 00:07:34.540
We're all doomed.

00:07:35.250 --> 00:07:36.130
Including yourself.

00:07:36.710 --> 00:07:38.210
It'll be fine!

00:07:38.300 --> 00:07:40.590
I'm sure Master will come save us!

00:07:43.890 --> 00:07:46.720
It's true! He saved me last time!

00:07:52.640 --> 00:07:53.520
See?

00:08:09.080 --> 00:08:10.370
Just as I thought.

00:08:11.870 --> 00:08:13.370
I've been expecting you.

00:09:02.420 --> 00:09:03.260
All right.

00:09:07.050 --> 00:09:08.010
Hang in there...

00:09:08.850 --> 00:09:09.680
Zero.

00:09:27.530 --> 00:09:29.910
I'm thankful for you all.

00:09:30.410 --> 00:09:33.040
You all provided me with a wonderful gift.

00:09:36.330 --> 00:09:37.170
Now...

00:09:37.960 --> 00:09:40.460
that business is settled,

00:09:40.540 --> 00:09:44.460
I've got one last job for you.

00:10:05.570 --> 00:10:08.360
Stop! Please don't! Stop!

00:10:08.530 --> 00:10:11.660
Please stop! Stop! Stop--

00:11:06.550 --> 00:11:07.710
He's here.

00:11:08.970 --> 00:11:13.050
Don't think it's that easy
to get to Unit Zero.

00:11:21.020 --> 00:11:22.150
He'll come save me.

00:11:22.810 --> 00:11:25.480
I know he will!

00:11:26.070 --> 00:11:27.230
I know it!

00:11:33.950 --> 00:11:35.330
<i>That's right.</i>

00:11:36.240 --> 00:11:40.660
<i>You haven't watched Inyo</i>
<i>die yet, have you?</i>

00:11:40.830 --> 00:11:43.500
What? Died...?

00:11:43.880 --> 00:11:45.540
<i>Here's the footage.</i>

00:12:10.360 --> 00:12:14.070
No!

00:12:16.200 --> 00:12:18.280
<i>Hurry up and get here, Inyo.</i>

00:12:19.080 --> 00:12:21.290
Say hello to your grave.

00:15:58.590 --> 00:16:00.880
<i>Doesn't it bring back memories, Inyo?</i>

00:16:02.590 --> 00:16:05.760
<i>Has it been three... No, four years now?</i>

00:16:06.350 --> 00:16:09.680
<i>Unit Zero's happy to see you too.</i>

00:16:10.350 --> 00:16:12.440
You've set traps in them too.

00:16:13.190 --> 00:16:14.350
<i>Them?</i>

00:16:14.850 --> 00:16:16.980
<i>Oh, them.</i>

00:16:17.060 --> 00:16:19.980
<i>Of course, just like earlier.</i>

00:16:20.610 --> 00:16:21.940
Why now?

00:16:22.400 --> 00:16:26.030
<i>Now? I know it feels like</i>
<i>a long time to you,</i>

00:16:26.120 --> 00:16:28.490
<i>but I remember it like</i>
<i>it happened yesterday.</i>

00:16:29.580 --> 00:16:32.370
I wanted to see you right away

00:16:32.460 --> 00:16:34.670
but we needed time to prepare,
thanks to you.

00:16:35.460 --> 00:16:38.500
You damaged a lot of things.

00:16:38.960 --> 00:16:40.420
You reap what you sow.

00:16:41.050 --> 00:16:43.840
<i>That's what a perpetrator always says.</i>

00:16:43.930 --> 00:16:45.380
<i>But it's all water under the bridge.</i>

00:16:45.470 --> 00:16:48.800
<i>And I'll gladly accept those words,</i>
<i>now that I'm stronger.</i>

00:16:50.100 --> 00:16:52.770
Our positions are flipped now.

00:16:56.150 --> 00:16:59.150
<i>There seems to be a misunderstanding.</i>

00:16:59.690 --> 00:17:02.110
<i>I'm not talking about our situation now.</i>

00:17:02.190 --> 00:17:05.530
<i>I'm saying that I'm stronger now.</i>

00:17:06.320 --> 00:17:07.240
And?

00:17:09.620 --> 00:17:10.450
Where is she?

00:17:12.040 --> 00:17:13.040
Where's Zero?

00:17:13.290 --> 00:17:14.960
<i>She's very close,</i>

00:17:15.290 --> 00:17:17.790
<i>but it seems like she</i>
<i>doesn't need to see you.</i>

00:17:17.880 --> 00:17:18.920
Where's Zero?

00:17:19.670 --> 00:17:21.920
<i>You're a persistent fellow.</i>

00:17:22.460 --> 00:17:23.840
That's why I came all this way.

00:17:25.090 --> 00:17:27.260
<i>You can't defeat me.</i>

00:17:27.640 --> 00:17:28.720
Where's Zero?

00:17:30.220 --> 00:17:31.430
Give her back to me.

00:17:33.220 --> 00:17:34.060
<i>Go.</i>

00:17:52.330 --> 00:17:53.830
Stop it!

00:18:02.300 --> 00:18:05.720
Impressive use of the column, but...

00:18:06.880 --> 00:18:08.760
<i>Will you be able to run from this?</i>

00:19:00.190 --> 00:19:02.270
What... What was that?

00:19:22.040 --> 00:19:23.380
<i>Wrong one.</i>

00:20:04.880 --> 00:20:09.000
Well, I knew I couldn't
finish you just yet.

00:20:17.350 --> 00:20:19.810
Look, you hurt yourself.

00:20:20.270 --> 00:20:22.440
But that's still nothing.

00:20:22.520 --> 00:20:23.480
Where is she?

00:20:24.650 --> 00:20:26.150
Where's Zero?

00:20:30.110 --> 00:20:31.820
Where is Zero?

00:21:09.980 --> 00:21:11.690
That's why I said,

00:21:12.110 --> 00:21:14.360
"You can't defeat me."

00:21:16.360 --> 00:21:19.200
I became a possessor of power myself.

00:21:20.910 --> 00:21:22.450
I'm a Lachter now.

00:21:31.300 --> 00:21:34.170
What? What's going on?

00:23:11.020 --> 00:23:13.480
PREVIEW

00:23:37.420 --> 00:23:39.420
<i>Next time, "Someday, the Two of Us..."</i>

00:23:39.970 --> 00:23:41.970
Subtitle translation by Sachiko Takahashi
